| Ruta Angular | `clientes` |
| Componente raíz | `src/app/clientes/clientes.component.ts` — carga tags y moneda al iniciar |
| Pantalla home clientes | `src/app/clientes/client-container/client-container.component.html` — 3 botones de acceso |
| Listado | `src/app/clientes/client-container/client-list/client-list.component.ts/html` — búsqueda, multiempresa, scroll infinito |
| Detalle | `src/app/clientes/client-container/client-detail/client-detail.component.ts/html` — tabs Detalle y DocVentas |
| Formulario potencial | `src/app/clientes/client-container/client-new-potential-client/client-new-potential-client.component.ts/html` |
| Listado potenciales | `src/app/clientes/client-container/client-potential-client/client-potential-client.component.html` |
| Cabecera / navegación | `src/app/clientes/client-header/client-header.component.ts` — botón atrás, guardar, enviar |
| Coordenadas | `src/app/clientes/client-container/client-location/client-location.component` |
| Documento de venta | `src/app/clientes/client-container/client-document-sale/client-document-sale.component.html` |
